Reading it
----------
'attn KV' grows linearly in T.  'KDA state' does not move at all -- that is the
architectural claim, stated as a measurement.

The model-level ratio is bounded by how many attention layers survive: a 3:1
hybrid keeps 9 of 36, so it cannot do better than ~4x however good KDA is.
The per-layer 100x only reaches the model level in the KDA-only variant.
Report both, and say which one the number belongs to.

